 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "start": 0.15,
   "speechStart": 0.15,
   "end": 7.75,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "On lakes, rivers and many Florida state waters, you’ll see a different family: white markers with orange symbols."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 8.0,
   "speechStart": 8.0,
   "end": 11.675,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "They’re regulatory markers, and each shape has a meaning."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 11.925,
   "speechStart": 11.925,
   "end": 13.75,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Look at the diagram."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 14.0,
   "speechStart": 14.0,
   "end": 18.4,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "An orange diamond means danger: a rock, a shoal, a stump."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 18.65,
   "speechStart": 18.65,
   "end": 20.925,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "The hazard is written inside."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 21.175,
   "speechStart": 21.175,
   "end": 24.1,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "A diamond with a cross in it means keep out."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 24.35,
   "speechStart": 24.35,
   "end": 26.575,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Swimming areas and dams."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 26.825,
   "speechStart": 26.825,
   "end": 32.7,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "An orange circle means a controlled area: a speed limit, idle speed, or no wake."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 32.95,
   "speechStart": 32.95,
   "end": 35.825,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "In Florida, where will you see those most?"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 36.075,
   "speechStart": 36.825,
   "end": 38.725,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "In manatee zones."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 38.975,
   "speechStart": 38.975,
   "end": 43.825,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "And an orange square gives information, like directions or distances."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 44.075,
   "speechStart": 44.075,
   "end": 50.4,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "One more that isn’t orange at all: a white buoy with a blue horizontal band is a mooring buoy."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 50.65,
   "speechStart": 50.65,
   "end": 52.525,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "So remember the shapes."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 52.775,
   "speechStart": 52.775,
   "end": 54.575,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Diamond, danger."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 54.825,
   "speechStart": 54.825,
   "end": 57.0,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Crossed diamond, keep out."
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "start": 57.25,
   "speechStart": 57.25,
   "end": 59.075,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Circle, control."
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "start": 59.325,
   "speechStart": 59.325,
   "end": 61.2,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Square, information."
  }
 ]
}
